OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 16 MAY
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,9,     GTom Service plays the best
OL,10,     Gclassical music alongside the
OL,11,     Glatest stories in the arts world,
OL,12,     Gwith special guest pianist Leif
OL,13,     GOve Andsnes.
OL,14,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,15,     GJools is joined by writer and
OL,16,     Gcritic Nicola Shulman.
OL,17,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,18,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,19,     GIt's the year 1521. On the road
OL,20,     Gto Worms, Martin Luther leads a
OL,21,     Ghymn as he faces judgement.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
