OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 16 MAY
OL,4,G1400FRecord Review
OL,5,     GAndrew McGregor with the best of
OL,6,     Gthe week's new classical releases.
OL,7,G1600FSound of Cinema
OL,8,     GThe finest film scores, weekly,
OL,9,     Gwith Edith Bowman. Will Bates
OL,10,     Gtalks to Edith about his score to
OL,11,     GTuner, and Hugh Tieppo-Brunt
OL,12,     Gtalks about Mica Levi's score to
OL,13,     GUnder the Skin.
OL,14,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,15,     GJess Gillam shares music choices
OL,16,     Gwith the Welsh composer Alex
OL,17,     GMills. Expect music by Machaut,
OL,18,     GMeredith Monk and Daft Punk as
OL,19,     Gwell as Sibelius and Alice
OL,20,     GColtrane.
